        "content": "## WF-05 Visual Asset Generation\nGenerates only missing images (≤ MAX_NEW_IMAGES_PER_EPISODE) with mock/codex/local provider, budget reservation per image → scene_assets_map.json.\n\nPOST /webhook/ass/wf05-visual-generate\nHeader: as configured in 'ASS Webhook Auth'\nBody: {\"episode_id\": 1, \"run\": \"r1\", \"chat_id\": 123}\n\nIdempotent: same episode_id+run → same job.",
